{
    "title": "RevDoc: Find a Verified Doctor",
    "description": "RevDoc brings the doctor to your doorstep.\r\n\r\nWith our first-of-its-kind mobile app, access to independent physicians and other practitioners offering hundreds of health and aesthetic services, from Botox\u00ae and other injectables at home to urgent care in the office and skin-rejuvenating lasers in a Luxe Mobile Clinic. Wherever you are, RevDoc connects you with healthcare providers within your service area\u2014home, hotel, office, dorm, or Airbnb.\r\n\r\nFor every RevPrivate member, RevDoc donates $300 to a local charity. For every Rev+ member, RevDoc donates $25 to a local charity. \r\n\r\nSay goodbye to waiting rooms. Use your HSA/FSA debit card or credit card for hassle-free payments.\r\n\r\nRevDoc is for everyone.\r\n\r\nRevDoc is the next-level in health and aesthetic services, bringing your doctor to your doorstep. Never sit in a waiting room again. Never fill out the same paperwork again and again. \r\n\r\nAccess hundreds of services at your home, office, hotel or Airbnb. \r\n- Botox & Fillers\r\n- Urgent Care\r\n- IV Therapy\r\n- Skin Rejuvenation\r\n- Sexual Health\r\n- Primary Care\r\n- At-Home Labs\r\n- Labs & ePrescription Services\r\n- Telemedicine\r\n- And much, much more\r\n\r\nWith RevDoc:\r\n- Your doctor comes to you\r\n- Get care when and where you want\r\n- Receive discreet, personalized care\r\n- Break free from insurance\r\n- Enjoy transparent pricing\r\n- Use HSA/FSA at checkout\r\n- Find same-day, evening, and weekend appointments\r\n- Access Luxe Mobile Clinics\r\n- Earn RevCash \r\n- For every Rev+ member, RevGives $25  to a local charity\r\n- For every RevPrivate member, RevGives $300 goes to a local charity",
    "descriptionHTML": "RevDoc brings the doctor to your doorstep.<br><br>With our first-of-its-kind mobile app, access to independent physicians and other practitioners offering hundreds of health and aesthetic services, from Botox\u00ae and other injectables at home to urgent care in the office and skin-rejuvenating lasers in a Luxe Mobile Clinic. Wherever you are, RevDoc connects you with healthcare providers within your service area\u2014home, hotel, office, dorm, or Airbnb.<br><br>For every RevPrivate member, RevDoc donates $300 to a local charity. For every Rev+ member, RevDoc donates $25 to a local charity. <br><br>Say goodbye to waiting rooms. Use your HSA/FSA debit card or credit card for hassle-free payments.<br><br>RevDoc is for everyone.<br><br>RevDoc is the next-level in health and aesthetic services, bringing your doctor to your doorstep. Never sit in a waiting room again. Never fill out the same paperwork again and again. <br><br>Access hundreds of services at your home, office, hotel or Airbnb. <br>- Botox &amp; Fillers<br>- Urgent Care<br>- IV Therapy<br>- Skin Rejuvenation<br>- Sexual Health<br>- Primary Care<br>- At-Home Labs<br>- Labs &amp; ePrescription Services<br>- Telemedicine<br>- And much, much more<br><br>With RevDoc:<br>- Your doctor comes to you<br>- Get care when and where you want<br>- Receive discreet, personalized care<br>- Break free from insurance<br>- Enjoy transparent pricing<br>- Use HSA/FSA at checkout<br>- Find same-day, evening, and weekend appointments<br>- Access Luxe Mobile Clinics<br>- Earn RevCash <br>- For every Rev+ member, RevGives $25  to a local charity<br>- For every RevPrivate member, RevGives $300 goes to a local charity",
